 win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568590/extras/b18388ae4b7007beddf12498d3adbcde.poster.avif?t=1778102536\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568590/extras/b18388ae4b7007beddf12498d3adbcde.webm?t=1778102536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568590/extras/b18388ae4b7007beddf12498d3adbcde.mp4?t=1778102536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Voice Chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-Platform Play - Available for PC, Mac, iOS and Android</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable Cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Maps &amp; Environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-Game Tasks &amp; Mini-Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Game Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular Updates &amp; New Content</p></li></ul>",
